WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.530
Time card 1: how many minutes are in 1 hours? Let us think carefully. Multiply by 60.

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:07.411
The answer is 60. Great work!

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:14.323
Time card 2: how many seconds are in 2 minutes? Let us think carefully. Multiply by

00:00:14.323 --> 00:00:16.966
60. The answer is 120. Great work!

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:23.933
Time card 3: how many minutes are in 3 hours? Let us think carefully. Multiply by 60.

00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:26.103
The answer is 180. Great work!

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:33.079
Time card 4: how many seconds are in 4 minutes? Let us think carefully. Multiply by

00:00:33.079 --> 00:00:35.761
60. The answer is 240. Great work!
